{"id":"038e64585683402b","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-analytical-hierarchy.md","title":"Strict Analytical Levels on Number Sets","display":"thm-analytical-hierarchy — Strict Analytical Levels on Number Sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-analytical-hierarchy","aliases":["68-thm-analytical-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-analytical-hierarchy — Strict Analytical Levels on Number Sets","depends_on":["[[68-thm-analytical-enumeration]]","[[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure]]","[[68-thm-analytical-level-inclusion]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"19.5 p.74 / PDF 83","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-statement-and-local-diagonal-proof-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-analytical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-analytical-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-analytical-hierarchy — Strict Analytical Levels on Number Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e5bbc43941063123\" href=\"?note=e5bbc43941063123\" title=\"68-thm-analytical-enumeration\">68-thm-analytical-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ebe52081fac785e\" href=\"?note=0ebe52081fac785e\" title=\"68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure\">68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7328203796df129b\" href=\"?note=7328203796df129b\" title=\"68-thm-analytical-level-inclusion\">68-thm-analytical-level-inclusion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"19.5 p.74 / PDF 83"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-diagonal-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{0,1}\">\\(X_{0,1}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 自然识别。无固定实参数的解析类及通用关系见所列直接依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n^{1,(0,1)}\\setminus\\Sigma_n^{1,(0,1)}\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad\\Sigma_n^{1,(0,1)}\\setminus\\Pi_n^{1,(0,1)}\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_n^{1,(0,1)}\\setminus\\Sigma_n^{1,(0,1)}\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad\\Sigma_n^{1,(0,1)}\\setminus\\Pi_n^{1,(0,1)}\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书19.5说证明同算术情形。用Σ层的通用二数关系U定义D={e:¬U(e,e)}，全递归对角代入与补集给D∈Π_n¹。若D有Σ_n¹索引d，则D(d)↔¬U(d,d)↔¬D(d)，矛盾；补集给另一方向。结合19.2也排除所有较低正层级。此严格性属于无参数自然数集合；允许任意实参数时同一结论不成立，参见投射层级的纯数关系条目。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-thm-analytical-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"e5bbc43941063123","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure","status":"resolved","id":"0ebe52081fac785e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-reducibility-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-analytical-level-inclusion","status":"resolved","id":"7328203796df129b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-level-inclusion]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"X_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n^{1,(0,1)}\\setminus\\Sigma_n^{1,(0,1)}\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad\\Sigma_n^{1,(0,1)}\\setminus\\Pi_n^{1,(0,1)}\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1467,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-hierarchy]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-analytical-hierarchy|thm-analytical-hierarchy — Strict Analytical Levels on Number Sets]]"}],"outgoing":["e5bbc43941063123","0ebe52081fac785e","7328203796df129b"]}